m/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/6aaad7297fdca14553ff9986_Halcyon-blog-hero-Halcyon-In-The-News-1200x630-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/6aaad7297fdca14553ff9986_Halcyon-blog-hero-Halcyon-In-The-News-1200x630-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/6aaad7297fdca14553ff9986_Halcyon-blog-hero-Halcyon-In-The-News-1200x630-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/6aaad7297fdca14553ff9986_Halcyon-blog-hero-Halcyon-In-The-News-1200x630-p-1600.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/6aaad7297fdca14553ff9986_Halcyon-blog-hero-Halcyon-In-The-News-1200x630-p-2000.jpg 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6568a1bce0ae49e6bedec3a6/6aaad7297fdca14553ff9986_Halcyon-blog-hero-Halcyon-In-The-News-1200x630.jpg 2400w" class="cms-card_image"></div></div><div class="cms-card_meta-wrapper"><div fs-cmsfilter-field="date" class="text-style-date text-color-blue">Sep 24, 2026</div><div class="category-link is-outline"><div fs-cmsfilter-field="category">Industry</div></div></div><div class="cms-card_title-link"><h3 fs-cmsfilter-field="title" class="heading-style-cms-card">Halcyon in the News: Cynthia Kaiser on the ShinyHunters Breach of the FBI</h3></div><div class="cms-card_description"><p fs-cmsfilter-field="description" class="text-size-small truncate">ShinyHunters claims it breached the FBI and stole data on nearly all agents. Halcyon's Cynthia Kaiser was quoted across CyberScoop, Axios, and Reuters on why the move is a tactical misstep, and why stolen personnel data never really goes away. </p></div><div class="cms-card_button-wrapper"><div data-w-id="7c0c7317-1185-f172-f55b-212e80f113ec" class="button-secondary"><div>Read the Blog</div><div class="button-secondary-icon-wrap"><div data-w-id="7c0c7317-1185-f172-f55b-212e80f113ef" style="transform: translate3d(0px, 0px, 0px) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0deg) rotateY(0deg) rotateZ(0deg) skew(0deg); 